<title>PORTUGAL: Cimpor says cement sales rose 26 pct Q1.</title>
<headline>Cimpor says cement sales rose 26 pct Q1.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cimpor-Cimentos de Portugal's cement sales rose 26.4 percent in the first quarter of 1997 to 1.302 million tonnes, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>Sales were 1.03 million in the same period last year.</p>
<p>Construction industry body ANEOP-Associacao Nacional de Empreiteiros &amp; Obras Publicas said Portuguese cement sales rose 27.1 percent in the first two months of 1997 to 1.45 million tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon bureau 3511-3113126</p>
</text>
